# Wallet, keystore, and credential artifacts (T15 — belt-and-suspenders).
# Globs are suffix-scoped so source files (e.g. utils/wallet_reconcile_cli.py)
# are not matched. Mirror+extend the equivalent .gitignore section.
*.p12
*.pfx
*.kdbx
wallet*.json
wallet*.dat
wallet*.txt
mnemonic*
private_key*
private-key*
keys/
keystore/
keystores/
*.keystore
# Geth/EVM keystore filename convention (e.g. UTC--2026-...--<address>).
UTC--*
